---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Features2 from '~/components/widgets/Features2.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Funding & Sponsors',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="px-6 mx-auto max-w-4xl">

    <Features2
      title="Funding & Sponsors"
      subtitle="How this project is supported and how you can contribute."
    />

    <div class="mb-10 space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">

      <p>
        This project is currently supported by individual contributors who believe in
        open research, cultural preservation, and the development of practical AI systems.
        Their support helps maintain infrastructure, develop new features, and keep the platform accessible.
      </p>

      <p>
        There are no large institutional sponsors at the moment. Instead, the project grows through
        small, direct contributions from people who share its goals and want to see it evolve over time.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you are interested in supporting the project — financially, technically, or through collaboration —
        feel free to get in touch. Contributions of any size or form are welcome, whether they are one-time
        or ongoing.
      </p>

      <p>
        You can contact us by email to discuss sponsorships, partnerships,
        or other ways to contribute.
      </p>

    </div>

  </section>
</Layout>